Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 16:06:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Misty: choose the Pokemon before flipping (#434)

Playing Misty now queues the choice among your [W] Pokemon first; the coins
are flipped only after the choice, through a new FlipUntilTailsThenAttach
action whose forecast attaches one [W] Energy from the Energy Zone per heads
(effect attachments, at most 5). Playability is unchanged (can_play_misty).

Tests: tests/trainers/misty_test.rs (the pending choices are the [W] Pokemon,
identical across seeds, nothing attached yet; then 0, 1, 2... Water on the
chosen Pokemon only).

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
